escription><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPNklmekFZWmFURnFwVlBHa2FlTGZwYkxaSkNSRUxMV2lsanFDc2hkdGF1RGhHWlJoUTBicHFXY1B3dWxHa0xmdU5mYzFBbGpYN3Z5N2xTS2U1bVBJeVZQVHRucldkRVhsVlVfNldnTWpRclIzSjJQa0tMMnBFVGhDTS1HYzdwVlctaXowdDJtdVJaNkxLcXo2Tk9Odi1XZnI0c1JScHZycXhWRUNUZmQ4?oc=5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:15:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 澳大利亚企业预计未来 12 个月通胀率将保持在 4% 以上</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months</link><description>澳大利亚企业预计，即使政策制定者今年加息五次以试图控制消费者价格，未来 12 个月通胀仍将远高于储备银行 2-3% 目标区间的上限。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months'&gt;澳大利亚企业预计未来 12 个月通胀率将保持在 4% 以上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Firms See Inflation Holding Over 4% for Next 12 Months&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-firms-see-inflation-holding-over-4-for-next-12-months</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 英国1000年的税收困境</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/168aa97b-1a58-480e-a995-31287308432f?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>紧张的公共财政和不愿削减支出塑造了一个扭曲得可笑的税收制度&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/168aa97b-1a58-480e-a995-31287308432f?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;英国1000年的税收困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Britain’s 1,000-year-old tax travails&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/168aa97b-1a58-480e-a995-31287308432f?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:00:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 黄的回归对美国资本主义来说是一个可怕的信号</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/cd688a72-04ed-40fb-9c26-5cae522a0abd</link><description>英伟达丑闻突显了为什么现在受到威胁的股东权利如此重要&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/cd688a72-04ed-40fb-9c26-5cae522a0abd'&gt;黄的回归对美国资本主义来说是一个可怕的信号&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Huang’s return is a terrible signal for US capitalism&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/cd688a72-04ed-40fb-9c26-5cae522a0abd</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:00:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报等2家] 英伟达停止向东南亚供应芯片</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/7838a715-07d4-4605-aa60-21f5af2b2370?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>此举之际，美国加强出口管制，阻止中国获得人工智能计算能力&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/7838a715-07d4-4605-aa60-21f5af2b2370?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;英伟达停止向东南亚供应芯片&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia halts chip shipments to south-east Asia&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOM1ZtZ1FmQ3d0Nk9xZzFmaDNtd3ZURjZ1cm1sWkptUktqcm1aOUc3eWpIYjVpUGoxWGxWd2FjRTZiTzBGRGtaTTA3ZUFsTEJLNk5BV3VfV2VKNHJVbk1mTDJqYkZkdEFPQ09jdzVHRzBHazlKVko5bVp4WDZMSUpUaEpyZk5ZUUUxbm42MjBIRWJCaGZzVXRkNklKN2dfdDRES3RwazQ1UU55Q3Bf?oc=5'&gt;据英国《金融时报》报道，英伟达停止向四个东南亚国家供应服务器&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia halts server shipments to four Southeast Asian countries, FT reports&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/7838a715-07d4-4605-aa60-21f5af2b2370?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:00:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] BBC发现德国船舶经销商涉嫌向海峡走私团伙供货</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqlymky8kpzjo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>据称，2026 年初，近三分之一的过境事件涉及德国男子公司的船只或发动机。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqlymky8kpzjo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;BBC发现德国船舶经销商涉嫌向海峡走私团伙供货&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：German boat dealer suspected of supplying Channel smuggling gangs, BBC finds&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqlymky8kpzjo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:00:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] DHL 的 Venter：供应链弹性是增长的关键</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video</link><description>DHL 供应链首席执行官 Hendrik Venter 表示，随着关税和地缘政治干扰使全球供应链变得更加复杂，弹性正在成为一种战略优势。他表示，DHL 第三季度同比增长 12%，其中 40% 以上来自首次外包。他与保罗·艾伦就“哈斯琳达·阿明的见解”进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video'&gt;DHL 的 Venter：供应链弹性是增长的关键&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：DHL's Venter: Supply Chain Resilience Is Key to Growth&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/dhl-s-venter-supply-chain-resilience-is-key-to-growth-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:15:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 加拿大向阿联酋投资者推介基础设施计划</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video</link><description>加拿大财政部长弗朗索瓦·菲利普·商鹏飞在迪拜对彭博电视台表示，加拿大正在从强势地位进入一个不断变化的全球秩序。他敦促中东投资者将长期资本投入该国的基础设施计划。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video'&gt;加拿大向阿联酋投资者推介基础设施计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Canada Pitches Infrastructure Plan to UAE Investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/canada-pitches-infrastructure-plan-to-uae-investors-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:16:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 经合组织表示，随着人口老龄化，印度尼西亚必须更快增长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/indonesia-must-grow-faster-as-its-population-ages-oecd-says</link><description>经合组织表示，印度尼西亚需要在未来二十年加快经济增长，才能在 2045 年成为高收入国家，随着人口老龄化，这一任务将变得更加艰巨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/indonesia-must-grow-faster-as-its-population-ages-oecd-says'&gt;经合组织表示，随着人口老龄化，印度尼西亚必须更快增长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Indonesia Must Grow Faster as Its Population Ages, OECD Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/indonesia-must-grow-faster-as-its-population-ages-oecd-says</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:28:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 塔塔信托公司支持针对塔塔儿子连任主席的诉讼</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tata-trusts-back-lawsuit-against-tata-sons-chair-s-reappointment</link><description>知情人士称，塔塔信托公司的大多数受托人投票赞成提起诉讼，反对纳塔拉扬·钱德拉塞卡兰 (Natarajan Chandrasekaran) 再次被任命为塔塔儿子私人有限公司 (Tata Sons Pvt.) 董事长，这表明这家印度企业集团的权力斗争正在升级。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tata-trusts-back-lawsuit-against-tata-sons-chair-s-reappointment'&gt;塔塔信托公司支持针对塔塔儿子连任主席的诉讼&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tata Trusts Back Lawsuit Against Tata Sons Chair’s Reappointment&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tata-trusts-back-lawsuit-against-tata-sons-chair-s-reappointment</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:44:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 小鹏汽车总裁谈汽车制造商的机器人推动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video</link><description>小鹏汽车副董事长兼总裁顾布莱恩 (Brian Gu) 讨论了仿人机器人技术作为汽车制造商的下一个增长动力。他在“彭博社：中国秀”上发表独家演讲。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video'&gt;小鹏汽车总裁谈汽车制造商的机器人推动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Xpeng President on Carmaker's Robot Push&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:45:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 卢比期权自二月份以来首次发出看涨信号</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february</link><description>自2月份以来，期权市场对冲卢比疲软相对成本的相对成本指标首次转为负值，表明人们对印度货币的乐观情绪日益增强。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february'&gt;卢比期权自二月份以来首次发出看涨信号&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Options Signal Bullish Shift for First Time Since February&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:48:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 西班牙选民前往投票站，值得关注的股票和债券</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-head-to-the-polls</link><description>西班牙高涨的股市在本周末的选举中受到很大影响，政府更迭的前景使得银行和公用事业等行业面临的风险最大。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-head-to-the-polls'&gt;西班牙选民前往投票站，值得关注的股票和债券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks and Bonds to Watch as Spain’s Voters Head to the Polls&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/stocks-and-bonds-to-watch-as-spain-s-voters-he